<title>MEXICO: Geupec to propose div to shareholders.</title>
<headline>Geupec to propose div to shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican bottler Grupo de Embotelladoras Unidas (Geupec) will propose a dividend of 150.6 million pesos at a shareholders' meeting on August 7, the company said.</p>
<p>The meeting will be held in Mexico City, the company said in a notice in the Official Gazette. ((-- Tomas de la Rosa, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7912))</p>
